er kunde, vielen dank für ihre kontaktaufnahme. bezüglich ihrer anfrage empfehlen wir ihnen, sich direkt an den amazon-kundendienst zu wenden. sie sind rund um die uhr verfügbar und können sie bei problemen wie stornierungen, rücksendungen oder lieferverfolgung effizienter unterstützen. vielen dank für ihr verständnis. beste grüße','2026-04-25 00:00:00',1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(35,1,28,'美国','英语','其他 - 买家问题','package arrived empty!!!! i need it tonight!!!!','包裹到达时是空的！！！！今晚我需要它！！！！','s39j0jksbj24dhn+8f2a2e2d-14d9-4bf4-a0ff-823cfe8fc633@marketplace.amazon.com','Dear customer,\nthank you for contacting us. regarding your inquiry, we recommend reaching out to amazon customer service directly. they are available 24/7 and can assist you more efficiently with issues like this. thank you for your understanding.\nbest regards','2026-04-26 00:00:00',1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(36,1,49,'法国','法语','其他 - 买家问题','Bonjour article arrivé endommagé mais je ne souhaite pas de retour car j’ai besoin d’une partie de la commande pour ce mercredi. Que pouvons-nous faire tout de même? Merci','您好，商品送达时已损坏，但我不想退货，因为我需要本周三的部分订单。我们还能做什么呢？谢谢','hqd6r21p3fpsn3n+6a74e5bb-cd56-4d51-999f-d34a67326538@marketplace.amazon.fr','Cher client, merci de nous avoir contactés. concernant votre demande, nous vous recommandons de contacter directement le service client amazon. ils sont disponibles 24h/24 et 7j/7 et peuvent vous aider plus efficacement en cas de problèmes tels que les annulations, les retours ou le suivi des livraisons. merci pour votre compréhension. cordialement','2026-04-27 00:00:00',1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(37,1,49,'法国','法语','其他 - 买家问题','Bonjour\nVoici une photo .\nLe B du birthday est cassé + la voiture dorée n’est pas collée sur le support. \nMerci','你好这是一张照片。生日的b坏了+金车没有粘在支架上。谢谢','hqd6r21p3fpsn3n+6a74e5bb-cd56-4d51-999f-d34a67326538@marketplace.amazon.fr','Cher client, merci de nous avoir contactés. concernant votre demande, nous vous recommandons de contacter directement le service client amazon. ils sont disponibles 24h/24 et 7j/7 et peuvent vous aider plus efficacement avec des problèmes comme celui-ci. merci pour votre compréhension. cordialement','2026-04-28 00:00:00',1,1,'1','2026-05-20 18:17:01',NULL),(38,1,28,'美国','英语','商品详情问答','Is this item made of latex at all?','这件物品是乳胶制成的吗？','j7xzdfymp3nvxzj+a8e298aa-a90a-4c66-8f7f-af58c3d74b9b@marketplace.amazon.com','Dear customer,\nthank you for contacting us. we have received your inquiry. our team will review it and get back to you within 1-2 business days during our working hours. thank you for your understanding.\nbest regards','2026-05-01 00:00:00',1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(39,1,37,'美国','英语','配送和追踪','I need these items overnight, will that be possible?','我需要这些物品过夜，可以吗？','swdswkrxxtfksx7+1d675861-e5d3-498b-91da-b7d9c5aa7d9c@marketplace.amazon.com','Dear customer,\nthank you for contacting us. regarding your inquiry, we recommend reaching out to amazon customer service directly. they are available 24/7 and can assist you more efficiently with issues like cancellations, returns, or delivery tracking. thank you for your understanding.\nbest regards','2026-05-01 00:00:00',1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(40,1,22,'法国','法语','发票请求','Je passe la commande de machine glace ninja et je besoin de facture','我正在订购忍者制冰机，需要发票','45x8vlndtbfb284+dff4bbc4-ea6f-41a3-9f68-9f1fe8cd7883@marketplace.amazon.fr','Cher client, merci de nous avoir contactés. votre demande nécessite un traitement manuel. nous l\'avons transmis à notre équipe spécialisée, qui vous assistera dans un délai de 1 à 2 jours ouvrables. nous apprécions votre patience. cordialement','2026-05-03 00:00:00',1,1,'1','2026-05-19 15:24:27',NULL),(41,1,29,'英国','英语','商品详情问答','*Food standards agency.','*食品标准机构。','x7c1pm1hvk1xmp3+54f7b506-e06c-4c58-811c-ea5fc8117ae1@marketplace.amazon.co.uk','Dear customer,\nthank you for contacting us. we have received your inquiry. our team will review it and get back to you within 1-2 business days during our working hours. thank you for your understanding.\nbest regards','2026-05-04 00:00:00',1,1,'1','2026-05-18 16:23:58',NULL),(42,1,41,'意大利','意大利语','商品详情问答','Salve, la prego di scusarmi molto. C\'è stato un misunderstanding in casa. È tutto a posto. Grazie e scusi ancora','您好，非常抱歉。家里发生了误会。没关系。再次感谢并抱歉','l9xz47z210sq886+3f056a7f-f34b-4743-8e77-d990730ac7a1@marketplace.amazon.it','Gentile cliente, grazie per averci contattato. abbiamo ricevuto la tua richiesta il nostro team lo esaminerà e ti ricontatterà entro 1-2 giorni lavorativi durante il nostro orario di lavoro. grazie per la comprensione. distinti saluti','2026-05-04 00:00:00',1,1,'1','2026-05-16 18:17:42',NULL),(43,2,46,'美国','英语','其他 - 买家问题','Hello, can the return window please be extended? The item is new, unopened, and I no longer need it.','您好，请问可以延长退货期限吗？该物品是新的，未开封，我不再需要它。','41z5b54kzln36sn+81c073cc-ca82-4056-8e44-c096a46ffcf9@marketplace.amazon.com','Dear customer,\nthank you for contacting us. regarding your inquiry, we recommend reaching out to amazon customer service directly. they are available 24/7 and can assist you more efficiently with issues like cancellations, returns, or delivery tracking. thank you for your understanding.\nbest regards','2026-05-09 00:00:00',1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(45,1,47,'英国','英语','配送和追踪','It says delivery today','上面写着今天送货','kyrw9vm74sf0c85+ca7c5b08-58f3-4365-b34e-d4dbc845a107@marketplace.amazon.co.uk','Dear Customer,\nThank you for contacting us. As we are currently in a holiday period, our team is unable to respond to your enquiry immediately. We will review and reply within 1-2 working days during business hours.\nRegarding your enquiry, we recommend contacting Amazon Customer Service first. They are available 24/7 and can assist you more efficiently with issues like cancellations, returns, or delivery tracking.\nShould you have any further questions, please do not hesitate to contact us again. Thank you for your understanding.\nBest regards','2026-05-29 09:17:01',1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46,1,20,'美国','英语','配送和追踪','Bought 4 sets and received one today. When will the additional three be sent?','买了4套，今天收到一套。额外的三个什么时候发送？','nbyv1wz5ddy3d05+69c5ff56-6f9e-44b6-8104-d07bf0c93edb@marketplace.amazon.com','Dear Customer,\nThank you for contacting us. As we are currently in a holiday period, our team is unable to respond to your enquiry immediately. We will review and reply within 1-2 working days during business hours.\nRegarding your enquiry, we recommend contacting Amazon Customer Service first. They are available 24/7 and can assist you more efficiently with issues like cancellations, returns, or delivery tracking.\nShould you have any further questions, please do not hesitate to contact us again. Thank you for your understanding.\nBest regards','2026-05-31 02:21:51',1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(47,1,29,'德国','德语','商品详情问答','Hi why are there no cups? It\'s listed on the description this comes with cups but none arrived','嗨 ， 为什么没有杯子 ？描述上列出了这个带有杯子的， 但没有到达','0pg9l56rtr63jmd+05832fe1-e512-4793-9b36-36699be4e7e5@marketplace.amazon.de','Sehr geehrte Kunden,\nVielen Dank, dass Sie uns kontaktiert haben. Wir haben Ihre Anfrage erhalten. Unser Team wird es überprüfen und sich innerhalb von 1 - 2 Werktagen während unserer Arbeitszeiten an Sie wenden. Vielen Dank für Ihr Verständnis.\nDie besten Blickwinkel','2026-05-31 02:27:27',1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(48,1,29,'德国','德语','商品详情问答','Because this was the cost of the cups I had to buy in an emergency','因为这就是我在紧急情况下买的杯子的价格','0pg9l56rtr63jmd+05832fe1-e512-4793-9b36-36699be4e7e5@marketplace.amazon.de','Sehr geehrte Kunden,\nVielen Dank, dass Sie uns kontaktiert haben. Wir haben Ihre Anfrage erhalten. Unser Team wird es überprüfen und sich innerhalb von 1 - 2 Werktagen während unserer Arbeitszeiten an Sie wenden. Vielen Dank für Ihr Verständnis.\nDie besten Blickwinkel','2026-06-01 02:09:51',1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL);
